                                <h3 style="font-weight: bold;">Eat {{ $calories_per_day }} calories per day</h3>
                                <p>Target {{ $calories_per_day }} calories per day with at least 75% consistency with the following macro split:</p>
                                <div class="row">
                                    <div class="text-center col-4">
                                        <p style="font-weight: 700;">PROTEIN</p>
                                        <div class="progress my-3 bg-transparent" style="height: 8px">
